      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Study idr0062A of the Image Data Resource, a nuclear segmentation study, imaged in LaminB1 and Dapi. The viewer reads this OME-Zarr store (NGFF 0.4, three pyramid levels) through the Depictio API, chunk by chunk, as the image is panned. Nothing is copied to the server. The store also holds the authors' nucleus segmentation as a label image (labels/0, same geometry), drawn here as coloured outlines, one per nucleus, on the plane shown.\n",
